        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nskinparam sequence {\n    ArrowColor #A31515\n    LifeLineBorderColor #A31515\n    LifeLineBackgroundColor White\n    ActorBorderColor #A31515\n    ActorBackgroundColor White\n}\n&#39; Đổi hình dáng đối tượng thành dạng tròn (BCE) giống hệt thầy\nskinparam boundaryBackgroundColor #FFFFCC\nskinparam boundaryBorderColor #A31515\nskinparam controlBackgroundColor #FFFFCC\nskinparam controlBorderColor #A31515\nskinparam entityBackgroundColor #FFFFCC\nskinparam entityBorderColor #A31515\n\n&#39; Khai báo các đối tượng với gạch chân và dấu hai chấm\nactor \&quot;&lt;u&gt;: Nhan su&lt;/u&gt;\&quot; as NS\nboundary \&quot;&lt;u&gt;: FrmKhenThuong&lt;/u&gt;\&quot; as Frm\ncontrol \&quot;&lt;u&gt;: KhenThuongService&lt;/u&gt;\&quot; as Svc\nentity \&quot;&lt;u&gt;: NhanVien&lt;/u&gt;\&quot; as NV\nentity \&quot;&lt;u&gt;: QDKhenThuong&lt;/u&gt;\&quot; as QD\nentity \&quot;&lt;u&gt;: PhieuChi&lt;/u&gt;\&quot; as PC\n\nNS -&gt; Frm : Nhap thong tin (nhan vien, ly do, so tien)\nNS -&gt; Frm : Nhan \&quot;Lap quyet dinh\&quot;\nactivate Frm\n\nFrm -&gt; Svc : taoQuyetDinh(maNV, lyDo, soTien)\nactivate Svc\n\nSvc -&gt; Svc : Kiem tra du lieu, so tien &gt; 0\nactivate Svc\ndeactivate Svc\n\nSvc -&gt; NV : kiemTraTonTai(maNV)\nactivate NV\nNV --[#A31515]&gt; Svc : ket qua kiem tra\ndeactivate NV\n\nalt [so tien hop le va ton tai nhan vien]\n    Svc -&gt; QD : themQuyetDinh(maNV, lyDo, soTien)\n    activate QD\n    deactivate QD\n\n    &#39; Áp dụng đúng BR10: Khen thưởng phải sinh phiếu chi\n    Svc -&gt; PC : themPhieuChi(maQD, soTien, \&quot;Khen thuong\&quot;)\n    activate PC\n    deactivate PC\n\n    Svc --[#A31515]&gt; Frm : KetQuaXuLy.Ok\nelse [du lieu khong hop le]\n    Svc --[#A31515]&gt; Frm : KetQuaXuLy.Fail (rollback)\nend\n\nFrm --[#A31515]&gt; NS : Thong bao ket qua lap quyet dinh\ndeactivate Svc\ndeactivate Frm\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="iYleK7Pf2dzxq_ztYEw2-232">
